<!--
  A play triangle cut clean through: play for video, the cut because this is an
  editor and not a player.

  The two halves are real geometry - the triangle clipped against the cut line and
  each half rounded on every corner - rather than a bar punched through a triangle
  with an even-odd fill. That shortcut renders the parts of the bar that overhang
  the triangle as solid spurs on either side, because they fall outside the shape
  being subtracted from.

  The glyph sits inside the central 66 of the 108 canvas, so it survives every mask
  a launcher applies, circle included.
-->
